 "You think 'we' and big words sound more trustworthy than 'I'.",
 ["Pretending to be bigger can backfire when they find out it's one person.","Small clinics often prefer one person they can call. 'Jag' is personal and honest.",
  "Plain language wins: Hopkins and Ogilvy both pushed for simple, specific copy over corporate language."],
 "I'm one person who does one thing well. I say 'jag', plainly.",
